            "text": "Carroll County Maryland is southeast of Adams County Pennsylvania where the 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is located in the municipality of Gettysburg. The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is categorised as a contributing property and Pennsylvania's Cumberland County is to the north of Adams County where the monument stands."
